			"notes": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/SaishoVibes/Back-in-Classic-Fabric/compare/v0.0.6-beta...v0.0.7-beta\n\n##  Changelog\n\nAdded Flower Features\n - Red Rose Feature\n - Blue Rose Feature\n - Shrub Feature\n - Paeonia Feature\n - Reb/Blue Rose Feature\n \nFixed Flower hitbox and recipe bugs\nFixed some minor Translation issues\nFixed Cauldron and some block models\nAdded Roses, Shrubs, and Paeonias to natural generation\n\n - Shrubs generate in all savanna biomes\n - Paeonias generate in all \"Old Growth\" biomes\n - Roses generare in custom biomes (ancient forest, rainforest, ice desert)\n \nUpdated to 0.0.7"
